---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Draws" path="/draws" description="Entries seal on chain. Sui's own randomness picks the winner. Anyone re-derives the result.">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="hero-field" data-field></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="cmd"><span data-glyph="terminal"></span>$ ./draws --describe</p>
        <h1>Draws <span class="tag tag-live">[ LIVE ]</span></h1>
        <p class="for">for competition promoters</p>
        <p class="lede">Entries seal on chain. Sui&#x27;s own randomness picks the winner. Anyone re-derives the result.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="markfig"><div class="markfield" data-mark="hero" data-mark-seq="mark,draws" role="img" aria-label="Blocks building the X, then the word draws."></div></figure>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap twocol">
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="cmd"><span data-glyph="ask"></span>// problem</p>
      <p class="prob">Entrants have to take the promoter&#x27;s word for who won. A screenshot is not evidence.</p>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="cmd"><span data-glyph="bolt"></span>// what you get</p>
      <ul class="gets"><li>Entries sealed on chain. Snapshot fixed at close.</li><li>Sui&#x27;s native randomness draws the winner.</li><li>Anyone can re-derive the result from public data.</li><li>Rules published as code, not as a paragraph.</li></ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap twocol">
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="cmd"><span data-glyph="tag"></span>$ pricing</p>
      <div class="pricing"><div><span>per entry</span><b>2.9% of ticket sales</b></div><div><span>the whole fee</span><b>locked into each competition at creation</b></div><div><span>no listing fee, no subscription</span><b>public leaderboard included</b></div></div>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="cmd"><span data-glyph="play"></span>$ start</p>
      <div class="startcmds"><span class="lbl">create</span><div class="cline"><span class="p">$</span><code>draws new --prize 500 --entries-open 72h</code><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="draws new --prize 500 --entries-open 72h" aria-label="Copy command"><svg><use href="#i-copy"/></svg><span data-copy-label>copy</span></button></div><span class="lbl">close</span><div class="cline"><span class="p">$</span><code>draws close &lt;id&gt;</code><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="draws close &lt;id&gt;" aria-label="Copy command"><svg><use href="#i-copy"/></svg><span data-copy-label>copy</span></button></div><span class="lbl">verify</span><div class="cline"><span class="p">$</span><code>draws reproduce &lt;id&gt;</code><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="draws reproduce &lt;id&gt;" aria-label="Copy command"><svg><use href="#i-copy"/></svg><span data-copy-label>copy</span></button></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" style="padding-block:48px"><div class="wrap"><p class="others">more? see the other four: <a href="/verify">./verify</a><a href="/weir">./weir</a><a href="/names">./names</a><a href="/range">./range</a></p></div></section>
</Layout>
